announcement-title-attention = Attention:

announcement-anomaly-alert-title = Anomaly Alert

announcement-anomaly-bluespace-text = Massive bluespace translocation detected.

announcement-anomaly-dimensional-text = Dimensional instability relocated. Expected location: { $area }.

announcement-anomaly-ectoplasm-text = Anomaly has reached critical mass. Ectoplasmic outburst detected.

announcement-charter-station-title = Captain's Charter

announcement-charter-station-text = { $user } has designated your station as { $name }

announcement-charter-banner-title = Captain's Banner

announcement-charter-banner-text = { $user } has designated the { $type } as { $name }

announcement-crab17-sender = CRAB-17 Protocol

announcement-crab17-destroyed-text = The credit deposit machine at { $area } has been destroyed. Station funds have stopped draining!

announcement-crab17-bubble-text = The spacecoin bubble has popped! Get to the credit deposit machine at { $area } and cash out before you lose all of your funds!

announcement-battleroyale-sender = Rumble Royale Pirate Broadcast Station

announcement-battleroyale-begin-title = Rumble Royale Beginning

announcement-battleroyale-begin-text = Congratulations { $station }, you have been chosen as the next site of the Rumble Royale! Viewers across the sector will watch our { $count } lucky contestants battle their way into your { $area } and fight until only one is left standing! If they don't make it in five minutes, they'll be disqualified. If you see one of our players struggling to get in, do lend them a hand... or don't, if you can live with the consequences! As a gesture of gratitude, we will be providing our premium broadcast to your entertainment monitors at no cost so that you can watch the excitement. Bystanders are advised not to intervene... but if you do, make it look good for the camera!

announcement-battleroyale-casualty-title = Rumble Royale Casualty Report

announcement-battleroyale-casualty-removed-text = Looks like someone removed and destroyed their implant, that's cheating!

announcement-battleroyale-winner-title = Rumble Royale Winner

announcement-battleroyale-winner-none-text = Somehow, it seems like there's no winner tonight. What a disappointment!

announcement-battleroyale-winner-text = With the death of { $loser }, only { $winner } remains. Congratulations, we have a winner!

announcement-battleroyale-winner-dq-text = With the disqualification of the other remaining contestant, only { $winner } remains. Congratulations, we have a winner!

announcement-battleroyale-winner-loser-text = With the death of { $loser }, we must sadly announce that the would-be winner has also been disqualified. Such bad showmanship!

announcement-battleroyale-update-title = Rumble Royale Update

announcement-battleroyale-update-text = We're halfway done folks! And bad news to anyone who hasn't made it to the { $area }... you're out!

announcement-battleroyale-end-title = Rumble Royale Concluded

announcement-battleroyale-end-text = Sorry remaining contestants, your time is up. We're sorry to announce that this edition of Royal Rumble has no winner. Better luck next time!

announcement-captaincy-captain-text = Captain { $name } on deck!

announcement-captaincy-acting-text = Due to staffing shortages, newly promoted Acting Captain { $name } on deck!

announcement-captaincy-acting-extreme-text = Due to extreme staffing shortages, newly promoted Acting Captain { $name } on deck!

announcement-ai-downloaded-text = { $name } has been downloaded to an empty bluespace-networked AI core at { $place }.

announcement-ai-replacement-text = Due to a research mishap, { $name } has been sent to be your replacement AI at { $place }. Please treat them with respect.

announcement-ai-announces-title = { $name } announces:

announcement-auxbase-locked-text = Auxiliary base landing zone coordinates locked in for { $zone }. Launch command now available!

announcement-ransom-title = Nanotrasen Asset Protection

announcement-ransom-text = One of your crew was captured by a rival organisation - we've needed to pay their ransom to bring them back. As is policy we've taken a portion of the station's funds to offset the overall cost.

announcement-topic-message-title = Incoming message from { $sender }

announcement-topic-breaking-title = Breaking Update From { $sender }

announcement-supermatter-observation-title = Nanotrasen Star Observation Association

announcement-supermatter-cascade-text = A Type-C resonance shift event has occurred in your sector. Scans indicate local oscillation flux affecting spatial and gravitational substructure. Multiple resonance hotspots have formed. Please standby.

announcement-supermatter-warning-text = Attention: Long range anomaly scans indicate abnormal quantities of harmonic flux originating from a subject within { $station }, a resonance collapse may occur.

announcement-supermatter-seeds-text = Reports indicate formation of crystalline seeds following resonance shift event. Rapid expansion of crystal mass proportional to rising gravitational force. Matter collapse due to gravitational pull foreseeable.

announcement-supermatter-shuttle-title = Shuttle Failure

announcement-supermatter-shuttle-text = Fatal error occurred in emergency shuttle uplink during transit. Unable to reestablish connection.

announcement-supermatter-escape-title = Emergency Shuttle

announcement-supermatter-escape-text = ERROR: Corruption detected in navigation protocols. Connection with Transponder #XCC-P5831-ES13 lost. Backup exit route protocol decrypted. Calibrating route...

announcement-supermatter-crystal-title = Nanotrasen Anomaly Department Announcement

announcement-supermatter-crystal-text = Anomalous crystal detected onboard. Location is marked on every GPS device.

announcement-spell-pipe-blockage-text = We detected a pipe blockage around { $area }, please dispatch someone to investigate.
